				"required": true,
				"description": "The input for verifying one exact commit: its commit and tree, the store root, the base and head revisions, the impact report, the verify config, the environment and the explained callback. The constructor keeps it and opens the record store at root, and run() and plan() read its other fields as they need them; a null baseCommit means nothing is proven, and an entity runs only its own scenario states, so the record is partial."
